This package contains no code from anthropics/commerce-agents. It targets that
project's StorefrontBackend interface and, in src/mercadopago_commerce_agents/types.py,
declares a type that is structurally compatible with
shopping_agent.types.CheckoutHandoff so that the unpublished shopping-agent-core
distribution is not required at install time.

